<title>USA: Intel buys 500,000 WavePhore shrs.</title>
<headline>Intel buys 500,000 WavePhore shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intel Corp has acquired 500,000 shares of WavePhore Inc for $4.0 million, WavePhore said on Friday.</p>
<p>Shares of WavePhore, a satellite broadcaster of data and other information, were up 11/16 at 11 in morning trading.</p>
<p>The Intel deal cancels Intel's warrant to acquire 250,000 shares of WavePhore. Intel bought the warrant in May 1995.</p>
<p>The deal also extends the relationship of Intel and WavePhore for extending WavePhore broadcast technology to personal computers.</p>
</text>
